  - Guy Lombardo And His Royal Canadians
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABWe Just Couldn't Say 'goodbye'\xBB, de
    1932, y llega hasta 1932."
  - "\xABThe Third Man Theme (Harry Lime Theme)\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa suave
    y un pulso cercano a 120 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABWhen Did You Leave Heaven?\xBB y \xABMoonlight
    Saving Time\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABThe Band Played On\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABA Sailboat in the Moonlight\xBB y \xABSeptember
    in the Rain\xBB."
